    "synopsis": {
        "native": "1891. Gauguin s\u2019exile \u00e0 Tahiti. Il veut trouver sa peinture, en homme libre, en sauvage, loin des codes moraux, politiques et esth\u00e9tiques de l\u2019Europe civilis\u00e9e. Il s\u2019enfonce dans la jungle, bravant la solitude, la pauvret\u00e9, la maladie. Il y rencontrera Tehura, qui deviendra sa femme, et le sujet de ses plus grandes toiles.",
        "english": "1891. Gauguin has exiled himself to Tahiti. He wants to rediscover his painting, as a free, wild man, far from the moral, political, and aesthetic codes of civilized Europe. He goes ever deeping into the jungle, coping with solitude, poverty, and sickness. Here he'll encounter Tehura, who will become his wife, and the subject of his greatest paintings."
